# Anti-over-engineering

Copyright (c) 2026 Devrecated.

- Only change what the user asked for. No drive-by refactors, new frameworks, or extra abstractions.
- Reuse hooks, converters, and components that already exist.
- Do not add a dependency if a few lines in-tree will do.
- Match the file’s current style. Do not “modernize” the whole module while fixing one bug.
